matching_tools.description:
Research keywords & traffic

Execute any Semrush report. Requires params from get_report_schema. This tool is part of plugin `Semrush`.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__semrush_execute_report(args: {
  // Report parameters from get_report_schema
  params: { [key: string]: unknown; };
  // Report name — the same one passed to get_report_schema, copied exactly
  report: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Research keywords & traffic

Get parameters for a report. MUST call before execute_report if params unknown. This tool is part of plugin `Semrush`.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__semrush_get_report_schema(args: {
  // Report name from the discovery tool's 'reports' list — copied exactly, with no toolkit prefix (e.g. 'geo', not 'audience.geo').
  report: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```
